cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the isoform models, please cite the article below."
title: "KLK4 transcript isoform analysis (Oxford Nanopore direct RNA and cDNA)"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, parameters and final isoform models (BED12, FASTA, read counts) for the
  reconstruction of KLK4 transcript isoforms from Oxford Nanopore direct RNA and cDNA
  sequencing of the prostate cancer cell lines 22Rv1 and C4-2B.
